[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3360099762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109192#issuecomment-3360099762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109192","id":3360099762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IRw2y","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T09:23:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T09:23:41Z","body":"As of today, only `create collision shape` support multi-selection, but it is doing it in an hacky way, doing a for-loop on `EditorNode::get_singleton()->get_editor_selection()`. \r\n\r\nThis PR suggest a better way of doing it using `MultiNodeEdit`, before we start adding multi-selection to:\r\n- MENU_OPTION_CREATE_UV2,\r\n- _create_outline_mesh(),\r\n- MENU_OPTION_CREATE_DEBUG_TANGENTS,\r\n\r\nTo make multi-select works for the actions of the Mesh menu would be a great addition for 4.6, as it is a quick win, and quite a time saver for level designers.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3360099762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368735546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109192#issuecomment-3368735546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109192","id":3368735546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IytM6","user":{"login":"aryan-11825114","id":62866798,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyODY2Nzk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62866798?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114","html_url":"https://github.com/aryan-11825114","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryan-11825114/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T04:19:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T04:19:08Z","body":"Hey there, just wanted to inform I will update this P.R. in a couple of days, as I am currently busy with my college exams, hope that's alright.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368735546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.